      #|  !V1 E1 V2 E2 p u v x y.\n        straight_line_embedding (V1:A->bool) E1 p /\\\n        straight_line_embedding V2 E2 p /\\\n        {u,v} SUBSET V1 /\\ {u,v} SUBSET V2 /\\\n        {u,v} IN E1 /\\ {u,v} IN E2 /\\\n        convex hull (IMAGE p V1) INTER convex hull (IMAGE p V2) =\n        segment[p u,p v] /\\\n        x IN V1 /\\ y IN V2 /\\ p x = p y\n        ==> x = y
      #|  ({u,v}:A->bool) IN E1
