      #|  x:real^2
      #|  straight_line_embedding (V2:A->bool) E2 (p:A->real^2)
      #|  straight_line_embedding (V1:A->bool) E1 (p:A->real^2)
      #|  !V1 E1 V2 E2 p u v e d.\n        straight_line_embedding (V1:A->bool) E1 p /\\\n        straight_line_embedding V2 E2 p /\\\n        INJ p (V1 UNION V2) UNIV /\\\n        {u,v} SUBSET V1 /\\ {u,v} SUBSET V2 /\\\n        {u,v} IN E1 /\\ {u,v} IN E2 /\\\n        e IN E1 /\\ d IN E2 /\\ ~(e = d) /\\\n        e SUBSET V1 /\\ d SUBSET V2 /\\\n        convex hull (IMAGE p V1) INTER convex hull (IMAGE p V2) =\n        segment[p u,p v]\n        ==> straight_edge p e INTER straight_edge p d =\n            IMAGE p (e INTER d)
      #|  (e:A->bool) IN E1
